WEBVTT

00:09:28.939 --> 00:09:32.484
for the laundry police?

00:09:32.985 --> 00:09:34.278
I don't know.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:36.280
There are rules to laundry.

00:09:37.281 --> 00:09:38.407
But for the first time,

00:09:38.449 --> 00:09:41.410
I stopped thinking about the way
that laundry should be done.

00:09:41.869 --> 00:09:43.287
And instead, started thinking

00:09:43.287 --> 00:09:45.873
about how I could make
laundry functional for me.

00:09:46.582 --> 00:09:48.626
And I looked down at the fleece pajamas

00:09:48.626 --> 00:09:50.628
and the underwear and the athletic shorts

00:09:50.628 --> 00:09:51.795
and the tank tops

00:09:51.837 --> 00:09:55.924
and realized almost none of my clothes
actually needed to be folded.

00:09:56.967 --> 00:09:58.802
And I haven't folded any of it since.

00:09:58.844 --> 00:10:05.726
(Cheers and applause)